# Intermediate certificates added to Node's trust store on AnythingMCP Cloud
# (NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS in docker-compose.cloud.yml) and in the keyless probe.
# Only for public upstreams that serve their leaf certificate without the
# intermediate: browsers and macOS fetch the missing one, Node does not and
# fails with UNABLE_TO_VERIFY_LEAF_SIGNATURE. Each entry is a public CA
# intermediate, never a private or self-signed root. Remove an entry once
# its upstream sends the full chain again.
#
# Sectigo Public Server Authentication CA DV E36 (issuer: Root E46),
# valid until 2036-03-21. Missing from warnung.bund.de (nina-warnung) since
# October 2026. Source: http://crt.sectigo.com/SectigoPublicServerAuthenticationCADVE36.crt
